  - m_Id: 71002845184
    m_Localized: According to the police database, an ID card belonging to a person
      named 'Kim Chul-soo' was found on Body #1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95078150144
    m_Localized: A diary was found. "I like my mother. I don't have a father, but
      I'm happy to have my mother. Even if other kids tease me that my last name
      is the same as my mom's, I'm still happy." The name "Choi Sun-woo" is written
      on the cover.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 471848284160
    m_Localized: Fake
